  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Strategic Fund 2021 - Internal Control Review BBCMA</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">Strategisk fond 2021</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">Syftet med den Strategiska fonden &#xe4;r att finansiera mindre initiativ som &#xe4;r strategiska f&#xf6;r genomf&#xf6;randet av strategin Regionalt Asien och Oceanien Kambodja 2021, men som faller utanf&#xf6;r ramen f&#xf6;r de st&#xf6;rre bidragen inom st&#xf6;domr&#xe5;det. Initiativ som kan finansieras genom denna insats &#xe4;r exempelvis relevanta f&#xf6;rberedande studier, revisioner, utv&#xe4;rderingar, studiebes&#xf6;k, evenemang, &#xf6;vers&#xe4;ttningar och publikationer. Insatser som &#xe4;r begr&#xe4;nsade i tid och arbetsinsats s&#xe5;som bidrag till angivna kostnadsobjekt f&#xf6;r konferenser, relevanta aktiviteter eller dylikt kan ocks&#xe5; finansieras inom insatsen.</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The purpose with the Strategic Fund is to finance smaller initiatives that are strategic for the implementation of the strategy Regional Asia and Oceania Cambodia 2021, but fall outside the framework of the larger contributions in the area of support. Initiatives that can be financed through the Strategic Fund are relevant preparatory studies, reviews, audits, evaluations, study visits, events, translations and publications. Contributions that are limited in time and workload such as a payment of specified cost items for conferences, relevant activities or such may also be financed through the contribution.</narrative>
  </description>
